// 绑定树上的「用到的导入包」收集（诊断收敛 D1）。产出 DepRef 编码（`ns#pkg#sym`），与绑定期
// `SymbolTable.NoteDepUse` 的记录合并后就是本文件的跨包依赖集（DEPS / E0436 的判据）。
//
// 为什么要单独一遍：绑定期的记录挂在「源码里写出的符号」上（类型引用、静态成员、自由函数），
// 而**接收者类型没写在源码里**的实例调用（`v.AsTimestamp().ToIso8601()`、`env.Symbols.Classes.Get(k)`）
// 只有 emission 的 VCall 兜底才记 —— 依赖集因此绑在代码生成上，有错时也就没法跳过代码生成。
// 这一遍在绑定树上补齐这类，判据是接收者的静态类型（绑定器已解析出 FQN），不依赖 emission 的短名表。
//
// 实现三个 bound visitor 接口：新增 Bound 节点类时这里编不过、直到处理它。
namespace Z42.Semantics;

public sealed class DepUseCollector : IBoundExprVisitor<Unit, Unit>, IBoundStmtVisitor<Unit, Unit>,
                                      IBoundPatternVisitor<Unit, Unit> {
    private SymbolTable _symbols;
    private string[] _items;
    private int _count;

    public DepUseCollector(SymbolTable symbols) {
        this._symbols = symbols;
        this._items = new string[8];
        this._count = 0;
    }

    // **排序后**返回：遍历顺序跟着 `SemanticModel.Bodies`（哈希表，迭代顺序不确定）走，不排序的话
    // DEPS 条目顺序随之漂 ⇒ 产物不确定（自举不动点 gen1≠gen2 实测抓到）。
    public string[] Items() {
        string[] r = new string[this._count];
        int i = 0; while (i < this._count) { r[i] = this._items[i]; i = i + 1; }
        int a = 1;
        while (a < r.Length) {
            string x = r[a];
            int b = a - 1;
            while (b >= 0 && r[b].CompareTo(x) > 0) { r[b + 1] = r[b]; b = b - 1; }
            r[b + 1] = x;
            a = a + 1;
        }
        return r;
    }

    // 方法体 + 静态字段初始化器（与 emission 发射的范围一致）。
    public static string[] Collect(SemanticModel model) {
        DepUseCollector c = new DepUseCollector(model.Symbols);
        string[] keys = model.Bodies.Keys();
        int i = 0;
        while (i < keys.Length) { c._stmt(model.GetBody(keys[i])); i = i + 1; }
        int s = 0;
        while (s < model.SiCount) { c._expr(model.SiInit[s]); s = s + 1; }
        return c.Items();
    }

    private void _note(string ns, string pkg, string sym) {
        if (pkg == "") { return; }
        string e = DepRef.EncodeSym(ns, pkg, sym);
        int i = 0;
        while (i < this._count) { if (this._items[i] == e) { return; } i = i + 1; }
        if (this._count == this._items.Length) {
            string[] g = new string[this._count * 2];
            int k = 0; while (k < this._count) { g[k] = this._items[k]; k = k + 1; }
            this._items = g;
        }
        this._items[this._count] = e;
        this._count = this._count + 1;
    }

    // 接收者静态类型来自导入包 ⇒ 记它的 ns + 归属包。本包类型 / 基元 / 型参：`ImportedPkgOf` 为 "" 不记。
    private void _noteType(Z42Type t) {
        string fqn = SymbolCollector.PkgCheckFqn(t);
        if (fqn == "") { return; }
        string pkg = this._symbols.ImportedPkgOf(fqn);
        if (pkg == "") { return; }
        int dot = fqn.LastIndexOf('.');
        this._note(dot < 0 ? "" : fqn.Substring(0, dot), pkg, fqn);
    }

    private void _expr(BoundExpr e) { if (e != null) { e.Accept<Unit, Unit>(this, Unit.Value); } }
    private void _stmt(BoundStmt s) { if (s != null) { s.Accept<Unit, Unit>(this, Unit.Value); } }
    private void _pat(BoundPattern p) { if (p != null) { p.Accept<Unit, Unit>(this, Unit.Value); } }

    private void _exprs(BoundExpr[] es, int n) {
        int i = 0;
        while (i < n) { this._expr(es[i]); i = i + 1; }
    }

    private void _stmts(BoundStmt[] ss, int n) {
        int i = 0;
        while (i < n) { this._stmt(ss[i]); i = i + 1; }
    }

    private void _pats(BoundPattern[] ps, int n) {
        int i = 0;
        while (i < n) { this._pat(ps[i]); i = i + 1; }
    }

    // ── 表达式 ──
    public Unit VisitCall(BoundCall c, Unit d) {
        if (c.Kind == "instance" && c.HasReceiver && c.Receiver != null) { this._noteType(c.Receiver.Type()); }
        if (c.Kind == "free" && c.FreeImported && c.FreeNs != null) {
            this._note(c.FreeNs, this._symbols.ImportedFuncPkgOf(c.MethodName, c.FreeNs), SymbolTable.QualOf(c.FreeNs, c.MethodName));
        }
        this._expr(c.Receiver);
        this._exprs(c.Args, c.ArgCount);
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitFuncRef(BoundFuncRef fr, Unit d) {
        if (fr.FuncImported && fr.FuncNs != null) { this._note(fr.FuncNs, this._symbols.ImportedFuncPkgOf(fr.FuncName, fr.FuncNs), SymbolTable.QualOf(fr.FuncNs, fr.FuncName)); }
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitMethodGroup(BoundMethodGroup mg, Unit d) {
        if (mg.Receiver != null) { this._noteType(mg.Receiver.Type()); }
        this._expr(mg.Receiver);
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitInterpolatedStr(BoundInterpolatedStr isr, Unit d) {
        int i = 0;
        while (i < isr.PartCount) {
            if (isr.Parts[i] is BoundInterpHole) { this._expr((isr.Parts[i] as BoundInterpHole).Inner); }
            i = i + 1;
        }
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitMember(BoundMember n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Target); return d; }
    public Unit VisitIndex(BoundIndex n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Target); this._expr(n.Index); return d; }
    public Unit VisitExpect(BoundExpect n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Target); return d; }
    public Unit VisitSwitchExpr(BoundSwitchExpr sw, Unit d) {
        this._expr(sw.Subject);
        int a = 0;
        while (a < sw.ArmCount) {
            BoundSwitchArm arm = sw.Arms[a];
            if (arm.HasPattern) { this._pat(arm.Pattern); }
            this._expr(arm.Guard); this._expr(arm.Body);
            a = a + 1;
        }
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitSeqExpr(BoundSeqExpr n, Unit d) { this._stmts(n.Prelude, n.PreludeCount); this._expr(n.Value); return d; }
    public Unit VisitAssign(BoundAssign n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Target); this._expr(n.Value); return d; }
    public Unit VisitBinary(BoundBinary n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Left); this._expr(n.Right); return d; }
    public Unit VisitUnary(BoundUnary n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Operand); return d; }
    public Unit VisitConditional(BoundConditional n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Cond); this._expr(n.Then); this._expr(n.Else); return d; }
    public Unit VisitIsExpr(BoundIsExpr n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitIsPatternExpr(BoundIsPatternExpr n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); this._pat(n.Pat); return d; }
    public Unit VisitCast(BoundCast n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitConvert(BoundConvert n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitBox(BoundBox n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitNew(BoundNew n, Unit d) { this._exprs(n.Args, n.ArgCount); return d; }
    public Unit VisitRefArg(BoundRefArg n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Inner); return d; }
    public Unit VisitArrayNew(BoundArrayNew n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Size); return d; }
    public Unit VisitArrayLit(BoundArrayLit n, Unit d) { this._exprs(n.Elems, n.ElemCount); return d; }
    public Unit VisitLambda(BoundLambda n, Unit d) {
        if (n.HasBlock) { this._stmt(n.BlockBody); } else { this._expr(n.ExprBody); }
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitIndirectCall(BoundIndirectCall n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Callee); this._exprs(n.Args, n.ArgCount); return d; }
    // 叶子：无子节点，也不以「接收者类型」引用导入符号（静态成员与类型引用由绑定期记录）。
    public Unit VisitLitInt(BoundLitInt n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitLitChar(BoundLitChar n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitLitFloat(BoundLitFloat n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitLitStr(BoundLitStr n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitLitBool(BoundLitBool n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitLitNull(BoundLitNull n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitIdent(BoundIdent n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitStaticGet(BoundStaticGet n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitCapturedIdent(BoundCapturedIdent n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitDefault(BoundDefault n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitError(BoundError n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitTypeof(BoundTypeof n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitMethodOf(BoundMethodOf n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitSymAvailable(BoundSymAvailable n, Unit d) { return d; }

    // ── 模式 ──
    public Unit VisitConstantPattern(BoundConstantPattern n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Value); return d; }
    public Unit VisitPositionalPattern(BoundPositionalPattern n, Unit d) { this._pats(n.Elems, n.ElemCount); return d; }
    public Unit VisitPropertyPattern(BoundPropertyPattern n, Unit d) { this._pats(n.Pats, n.FieldCount); return d; }
    public Unit VisitOrPattern(BoundOrPattern n, Unit d) { this._pats(n.Alts, n.Count); return d; }
    public Unit VisitAtPattern(BoundAtPattern n, Unit d) { this._pat(n.Sub); return d; }
    public Unit VisitRangePattern(BoundRangePattern n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Lo); this._expr(n.Hi); return d; }
    public Unit VisitRelationalPattern(BoundRelationalPattern n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Value); return d; }
    public Unit VisitWildcardPattern(BoundWildcardPattern n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitTypePattern(BoundTypePattern n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitBindingPattern(BoundBindingPattern n, Unit d) { return d; }

    // ── 语句 ──
    public Unit VisitVarDecl(BoundVarDeclStmt n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Init); return d; }
    public Unit VisitDeconstructDecl(BoundDeconstructDeclStmt n, Unit d) { this._pat(n.Pat); this._expr(n.Init); return d; }
    public Unit VisitReturn(BoundReturn n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Value); return d; }
    public Unit VisitExprStmt(BoundExprStmt n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitLocalFunction(BoundLocalFunction n, Unit d) { this._stmt(n.Body); return d; }
    public Unit VisitBlock(BoundBlock n, Unit d) { this._stmts(n.Stmts, n.Count); return d; }
    public Unit VisitIf(BoundIf n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Cond); this._stmt(n.Then); this._stmt(n.Else); return d; }
    public Unit VisitTry(BoundTry n, Unit d) {
        this._stmt(n.TryBody);
        int i = 0; while (i < n.CatchCount) { this._stmt(n.Catches[i].Body); i = i + 1; }
        this._stmt(n.Finally);
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitThrow(BoundThrow n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.E); return d; }
    public Unit VisitWhile(BoundWhile n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Cond); this._stmt(n.Body); return d; }
    public Unit VisitDoWhile(BoundDoWhile n, Unit d) { this._stmt(n.Body); this._expr(n.Cond); return d; }
    public Unit VisitSwitch(BoundSwitch sw, Unit d) {
        this._expr(sw.Subject);
        int c = 0;
        while (c < sw.CaseCount) {
            BoundSwitchCase cs = sw.Cases[c];
            if (cs.HasPattern) { this._pat(cs.Pattern); }
            this._expr(cs.Guard);
            this._stmts(cs.Body, cs.BodyCount);
            c = c + 1;
        }
        return d;
    }
    public Unit VisitFor(BoundFor n, Unit d) { this._stmt(n.Init); this._expr(n.Cond); this._expr(n.Incr); this._stmt(n.Body); return d; }
    public Unit VisitForeach(BoundForeach n, Unit d) { this._expr(n.Collection); this._stmt(n.Body); return d; }
    public Unit VisitBreak(BoundBreak n, Unit d) { return d; }
    public Unit VisitContinue(BoundContinue n, Unit d) { return d; }
}
